<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Areej — UI/UX Design</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --cream:#F5EFE6;
    --sand:#E8DDD0;
    --warm-mid:#C9B99A;
    --umber:#8B6F47;
    --deep-umber:#5C4A2A;
    --charcoal:#2C1F0E;
    --terracotta:#A0522D;
    --muted:#9C8B76;
    --divider: rgba(92,74,42,0.15);
    --max: 720px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--charcoal);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  ::selection{ background:var(--terracotta); color:var(--cream); }

  a{ color:inherit; }

  .wrap{
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 28px;
  }

  header.top{
    padding:28px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--divider);
  }
  header.top .wrap{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .mark{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:19px;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  nav a{
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--umber);
    margin-left:22px;
  }
  nav a:hover{ color:var(--terracotta); }

  /* HERO */
  .hero{
    padding:88px 0 72px;
  }
  .hero .kicker{
    font-size:15px;
    color:var(--umber);
    margin:0 0 18px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(34px, 6vw, 52px);
    line-height:1.18;
    margin:0 0 26px;
    max-width: 15ch;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--terracotta);
  }
  .hero p.lede{
    max-width:52ch;
    font-size:18px;
    color:#4a3a22;
    margin:0 0 34px;
  }
  .hero .roles{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .roles span{
    font-size:13px;
    padding:7px 13px;
    border:1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius:100px;
    color:var(--deep-umber);
    background: rgba(232,221,208,0.5);
  }

  /* SECTION LABELS */
  .section-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:38px;
    padding-top:64px;
  }
  .section-head h2{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:28px;
    margin:0;
  }
  .section-head .count{
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--muted);
  }

  /* CASE STUDIES */
  .case{
    padding:44px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--divider);
  }
  .case:first-of-type{ border-top:none; }
  .case-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    gap:24px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .case-name{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:30px;
    margin:0 0 6px;
  }
  .case-role{
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--umber);
  }
  .case-tag{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--deep-umber);
    background:var(--sand);
    padding:6px 12px;
    border-radius:100px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .case p{
    max-width:60ch;
    margin:0 0 18px;
    color:#3a2c15;
  }
  .case h4{
    font-size:13px;
    text-transform:none;
    color:var(--terracotta);
    margin:26px 0 10px;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .case ul{
    margin:0 0 18px;
    padding-left:20px;
  }
  .case li{
    margin-bottom:8px;
    color:#3a2c15;
  }

  /* swatch strip - real Muqahhar palette */
  .swatches{
    display:flex;
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
    margin:22px 0 8px;
    border:1px solid var(--divider);
  }
  .swatch{
    flex:1;
    height:56px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .swatch-label{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }

  /* wireframe illustration for muqahhar - masonry mock */
  .device{
    border:1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--sand);
    padding:16px;
    margin:22px 0 30px;
  }
  .device-bar{
    display:flex;
    gap:6px;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .device-bar span{
    width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--warm-mid);
  }
  .masonry{
    columns:3;
    column-gap:8px;
  }
  .masonry div{
    background:var(--cream);
    border:1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius:6px;
    margin-bottom:8px;
    break-inside:avoid;
  }
  .masonry div:nth-child(1){height:70px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(2){height:44px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(3){height:58px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(4){height:50px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(5){height:80px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(6){height:40px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(7){height:60px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(8){height:46px;}
  .masonry div:nth-child(9){height:66px;}

  /* amanat trust diagram */
  .trust-flow{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0;
    margin:22px 0 30px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .trust-node{
    border:1px solid var(--divider);
    background:var(--sand);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:16px 18px;
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--deep-umber);
    min-width:120px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .trust-arrow{
    color:var(--warm-mid);
    padding:0 10px;
    font-size:18px;
  }

  /* ABOUT */
  .about-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap:28px;
  }
  .about-block h4{
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--terracotta);
    margin:0 0 10px;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .about-block p, .about-block li{
    font-size:15px;
    color:#3a2c15;
    margin:0;
  }
  .about-block ul{
    padding-left:18px;
    margin:0;
  }
  .about-block li{ margin-bottom:6px; }

  /* CONTACT / FOOTER */
  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--divider);
    margin-top:70px;
    padding:44px 0 60px;
  }
  footer h2{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:26px;
    margin:0 0 14px;
  }
  footer p{
    max-width:48ch;
    color:#4a3a22;
    margin:0 0 22px;
  }
  .contact-links{
    display:flex;
    gap:20px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .contact-links a{
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:14px;
    padding:10px 18px;
    border:1px solid var(--deep-umber);
    border-radius:100px;
    color:var(--deep-umber);
    transition: background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .contact-links a:hover{
    background:var(--deep-umber);
    color:var(--cream);
  }
  .fine{
    margin-top:40px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
  }


  /* embedded prototype */
  .proto{
    width:min(1040px, calc(100vw - 32px));
    position:relative;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    margin:22px 0 10px;
    border:1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--sand);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .proto-bar{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:10px 14px;
  }
  .proto-bar .dots{ display:flex; gap:6px; }
  .proto-bar .dots span{ width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--warm-mid); }
  .proto-bar button{
    font:inherit; font-size:12.5px;
    background:none; border:1px solid var(--deep-umber);
    color:var(--deep-umber); border-radius:100px;
    padding:5px 13px; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .proto-bar button:hover{ background:var(--deep-umber); color:var(--cream); }
  .proto iframe{
    display:block; width:100%; height:640px; border:0; background:#fdfcfa;
  }
  .proto-note{ font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin:0 0 26px; }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .proto iframe{ height:520px; } }

  @media (max-width:600px){
    .about-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .hero{ padding:56px 0 48px; }
    nav a{ margin-left:14px; font-size:13px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mark">Areej Fatima</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#work">Work</a>
      <a href="#writing">Writing</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

  <section class="hero">
    <p class="kicker">UI/UX Designer</p>
    <h1>I design products people trust <em>before they read a word.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Computer Science student at IBA Karachi, currently leading UI/UX for Muqahhar and shaping the product design of Amanat. I work at the intersection of visual craft and the unglamorous decisions — verification flows, empty states, pricing logic — that make a product usable.</p>
    <div class="roles">
      <span>Product Design</span>
      <span>Design Systems</span>
      <span>Prototyping</span>
      <span>0→1 Product</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="work">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Selected work</h2>
      <span class="count">Case study</span>
    </div>

    <!-- CASE STUDY 2: AMANAT -->
    <article class="case">
      <div class="case-top">
        <div>
          <h3 class="case-name">Amanat</h3>
          <div class="case-role">Product &amp; UI Design — 0→1 product</div>
        </div>
        <span class="case-tag">P2P rental marketplace</span>
      </div>

      <p>Amanat is a peer-to-peer rental marketplace for Pakistan — think "Airbnb for things" — built around the core problem that makes renting between strangers hard: trust.</p>

      <h4>The problem</h4>
      <p>Peer-to-peer rental only works if both sides believe the other party is real and accountable. Without a national identity layer built in from the start, that trust never forms and the marketplace never gets liquidity.</p>

      <h4>What I designed</h4>
      <p>I designed the trust layer as the spine of the product, not an add-on — CNIC-based identity verification, security deposits, and space for insurance partnerships built into the rental flow itself.</p>

      <div class="trust-flow">
        <div class="trust-node">CNIC verification</div>
        <div class="trust-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="trust-node">Listing &amp; deposit</div>
        <div class="trust-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="trust-node">Insured handoff</div>
      </div>


      <h4>The interface</h4>
      <p>A working front-end prototype. Browse and filter listings, open an item to see its security deposit and booking panel, then scroll through how the rental flow works, the trust features, and the list-an-item page. Everything below is clickable.</p>
      <div class="proto">
        <div class="proto-bar">
          <div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <button type="button" onclick="openProto()">Open full screen</button>
        </div>
